# board.pdl - the deskopoly board as data (pass 1, 2026-11-07). One authority for tiles; deskopoly.c reads it and never hard-codes a tile.
# TILE | idx | name | kind | price | rent | group
#   kind: go (pass-GO bonus is a RULE) | prop (buyable; rent is the base rent, doubled when the owner holds the whole group) | tax (price = amount paid to the bank) | rest (nothing happens)
#   group: 0..n for props, -1 otherwise. Names are plain placeholders on purpose (no trademarked Monopoly names); rename freely, nothing else reads them.
TILE | 0  | Start     | go   | 0   | 0  | -1
TILE | 1  | Block 1   | prop | 60  | 6  | 0
TILE | 2  | Block 2   | prop | 60  | 6  | 0
TILE | 3  | Block 3   | prop | 80  | 8  | 0
TILE | 4  | Levy A    | tax  | 100 | 0  | -1
TILE | 5  | Block 5   | prop | 100 | 10 | 1
TILE | 6  | Block 6   | prop | 120 | 12 | 1
TILE | 7  | Block 7   | prop | 140 | 14 | 1
TILE | 8  | Rest      | rest | 0   | 0  | -1
TILE | 9  | Block 9   | prop | 160 | 16 | 2
TILE | 10 | Block 10  | prop | 180 | 18 | 2
TILE | 11 | Block 11  | prop | 200 | 20 | 2
TILE | 12 | Levy B    | tax  | 150 | 0  | -1
TILE | 13 | Block 13  | prop | 220 | 24 | 3
TILE | 14 | Block 14  | prop | 240 | 26 | 3
TILE | 15 | Block 15  | prop | 260 | 28 | 3
